  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Apoyo a la Mejora de la Gestin Fiscal y la Reactivacin Econmica</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support Program to Improve Fiscal Management and Economic Recovery</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general de desarrollo del programa consiste en apoyar la recuperacin econmica y social en Argentina. Los objetivos especficos de desarrollo son: (i) fortalecer las finanzas pblicas; (ii) contribuir a la estabilidad de precios; y (iii) fortalecer la balanza de pagos.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall development objective of the program is to support economic and social recovery in Argentina. The specific development objectives are: (i) strengthen public finances; (ii) contribute to price stability; and (iii) strengthen the balance of payments.</narrative>
  </description>
